</span></a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//doi.org/10.1080%2F09672550210121432\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080%2F09672550210121432\"><span title=\"數位物件識別號\">doi:10.1080/09672550210121432</span></a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E6%80%A7&amp;rft.atitle=Power%2C+Subjectivity%2C+and+Agency%3A+Between+Arendt+and+Foucault&amp;rft.aufirst=Amy&amp;rft.aulast=Allen&amp;rft.date=2002&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.jtitle=International+Journal+of+Philosophical+Studies&amp;rft.pages=131-49&amp;rft.volume=10&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A144541333&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1080%2F09672550210121432&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-:1-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-:1_4-0\"><sup><b>4.0</b></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-:1_4-1\"><sup><b>4.1</b></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFGonzalez&#95;Rey2019\" class=\"citation journal\">Gonzalez Rey, Fernando. Subjectivity in Debate: Some Psychology. Journal for the Theory of Social Behaviour. June 2019, <b>49</b>: 212–234 &#8211;透過EBCOhost.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E6%80%A7&amp;rft.atitle=Subjectivity+in+Debate%3A+Some+Psychology&amp;rft.aufirst=Fernando&amp;rft.aulast=Gonzalez+Rey&amp;rft.date=2019-06&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+for+the+Theory+of+Social+Behaviour&amp;rft.pages=212-234&amp;rft.volume=49&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><span class=